                . '<li><b>EIRs calculated, awaiting approval and lock</b> (EIR Calculations)</li>'
                . '<li><b>Repayment schedules awaiting review</b> (EIR Data, Schedule Review)</li>'
                . '<li><b>Fees awaiting classification review</b> (EIR Rules, Fee Classification)</li>'
                . '<li><b>EIR accounting rules not yet approved</b> (EIR Rules, Accounting Rules)</li>'
                . '<li><b>SICR trigger alerts proposed</b> (Staging &amp; SICR Rules, SICR Trigger Alerts)</li>'
                . '<li><b>Scenario sets proposed</b> (Scenarios &amp; Overlays, Scenario Sets)</li>'
                . '<li><b>Forward-looking regression fits proposed</b> (Forward-Looking Model, Regression)</li>'
                . '<li><b>External forward-looking models proposed</b> (Forward-Looking Model, Model Versions)</li>'
                . '<li><b>Manual overlays proposed</b> (Scenarios &amp; Overlays, Manual Overlays)</li>'
                . '<li><b>Forward-looking months recorded, awaiting sign-off</b> (FLI Month-End, Overview)</li></ul>'
                . '<p>The tab only counts and links; the approval itself is made on the linked screen, by a user who holds that screen\'s approval permission and who did not propose the item.</p>'
                . '<h4>The Team messages tab</h4><p>A header <b>Team conversation</b> with <b>Period 2025-11, visible to everyone signed in</b>; message bubbles (yours on the right in green, other people\'s on the left in grey) with the sender\'s name and a relative time such as <b>2 hours ago</b>; a box with the prompt <b>Message the team about this period...</b> and a green <b>Send</b> button with a paper-plane icon. The fifty most recent messages for the month are shown, together with any message posted without a month.</p>'
                . '<h4>Buttons and icons</h4><ul>'
                . '<li><b>Green arrow</b> (<b>Open this screen</b>): opens the screen where the step is done. Your role still needs that screen\'s permission.</li>'
